    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A fantasy roguelite RPG where eight heroes reincarnate to stop the mystic dragon Umbra. </i><br>Master turn-based combat, sever giant bosses, and shape your journey through relics and evolving NPC interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/83db1aafbf083d12d15a4c9405ee5bcc.poster.avif?t=1754886115\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/83db1aafbf083d12d15a4c9405ee5bcc.webm?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/83db1aafbf083d12d15a4c9405ee5bcc.mp4?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Combat</strong>: Time your skills, break enemy defenses, and target body parts across vertical zones (Low, Mid, High).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break &amp; Sever System</strong>: Exploit weaknesses to break enemies, then sever limbs to disable attacks and change boss stances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relic-Driven Builds</strong>: Equip relics to transform basic skills, add elements, status effects, multi-hit combos, or tactical twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Action System</strong>: Each hero interacts with NPCs differently, steal, hire, learn, or extract info with real consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reincarnation Loop</strong>: The world resets with each failure. NPCs change. Maps shift. Storylines evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Villages</strong>: Shops, quests, and NPCs evolve between runs based on your past actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giant Boss Battles</strong>: Face towering multi-part colossi with independent limbs, weaknesses, and devastating moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/73b923a933d09a4e596f96b496576035.poster.avif?t=1754886115\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/73b923a933d09a4e596f96b496576035.webm?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/73b923a933d09a4e596f96b496576035.mp4?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 playable heroes</strong>, each with unique skills and NPC interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 major worlds</strong>, each with branching routes and evolving villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>120 unique enemies</strong> and <strong>30 multi-phase bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>80 combat skills</strong> across weapon and magic types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>90 relics</strong> that dramatically change combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ hand-crafted events</strong> with lasting impact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent upgrades</strong> to shops, inns, NPC systems, and skills, grow stronger after every failure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/a02141289f4b5bc8ef5f71f8b6d2be81.poster.avif?t=1754886115\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/a02141289f4b5bc8ef5f71f8b6d2be81.webm?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/a02141289f4b5bc8ef5f71f8b6d2be81.mp4?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
