 Shops, quests, and NPCs evolve between runs based on your past actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Giant Boss Battles</strong>: Face towering multi-part colossi with independent limbs, weaknesses, and devastating moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/73b923a933d09a4e596f96b496576035.poster.avif?t=1754886115\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/73b923a933d09a4e596f96b496576035.webm?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/73b923a933d09a4e596f96b496576035.mp4?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 playable heroes</strong>, each with unique skills and NPC interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 major worlds</strong>, each with branching routes and evolving villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>120 unique enemies</strong> and <strong>30 multi-phase bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>80 combat skills</strong> across weapon and magic types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>90 relics</strong> that dramatically change combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ hand-crafted events</strong> with lasting impact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent upgrades</strong> to shops, inns, NPC systems, and skills, grow stronger after every failure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/a02141289f4b5bc8ef5f71f8b6d2be81.poster.avif?t=1754886115\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/a02141289f4b5bc8ef5f71f8b6d2be81.webm?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755930/extras/a02141289f4b5bc8ef5f71f8b6d2be81.mp4?t=1754886115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
